OL,3,AMillions without power as Cuba hit by
OL,4,Alatest major blackout
OL,5,
OL,6,FMillions in Cuba were left without
OL,7,Fpower on Friday as the country was
OL,8,Fplunged into yet another major
OL,9,Fblackout.
OL,11,FThe country's entire electricity grid
OL,12,Fsuffered "total disconnection" that
OL,13,Ftriggered a nationwide outage, Cuba's
OL,14,Fenergy ministry said.
OL,16,FPower was restored to some priority
OL,17,Fareas by late evening, including those
OL,18,Fnear hospitals and water pumping
OL,19,Fstations in the capital Havana, grid
OL,20,Foperator UNE said.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
