OL,3,AMillions without power as Cuba hit by
OL,4,Alatest major blackout
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is at least the sixth partial or
OL,7,Ftotal blackout to hit Cuba this year,
OL,8,Fwhere ageing electricity infrastructure
OL,9,Fand chronic fuel shortages have been
OL,10,Fplaced under further strain by a US
OL,11,Fblockade on oil shipments to the
OL,12,Fcommunist-run nation.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
